# Run artifacts from the skills in this repo.
#
# This repo holds skill *source*. Anything a skill produces when you actually
# run it is transient output for that run — it belongs to the working directory
# you ran it in, not to the skill definition.
#
# Skills whose artifacts land outside a repo need nothing here:
#   repo-docs        clones to a scratch dir ($TMPDIR/repo-docs/<name>)
#   mirror-remotes   state and logs in ~/.config/ and ~/.local/state/git-backup/

# repo-descriptions — the plan-phase review file, regenerated every run
descriptions-review.json

# inbox-to-dataset — the extraction. `raw/` and the de-anonymised build must
# never be committed; see Phase 5 of that skill. `public.json` is meant to be
# published, but as part of a write-up, not from this repo.
raw/
all.jsonl
private.json
public.json
